      "uid": "zhcn:556f0c29139b1f77e60e8748",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "为了证明当代最快，优骏们\\n正挑战这片草地的大舞台！\\n育马者杯草地短途赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "781848bb29c1d3c65508dc82be96e56c4c021f79159aa1a2e1a634ce093bdff9",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9170"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4ff87e17c118ddf1843b75f",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "第一是%h_rank_l1！\\n展现出甩开众对手的速度，\\n在草地短途战线上夺得了头名！",
      "source_fingerprint": "192e36e9ace7111ff60f9f5b969ca7732a2e9989135f8f74f42402dfa6f75d44",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9171"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc8095db20a582a9b4d33a76",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "今年最强的沙土女王即将在此时决出\\n育马者杯雌马大赛！\\n击败精锐并登上顶峰的会是哪位赛马娘呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98205920e15ca4623ab2414e29196c3ce71e74b9a3d3c8e968b3ff88ffd0edb4",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9172"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7c57c4fd2b5590d4424660f",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "成功了，%h_rank_l1!\\n精彩地击败了精锐们，在此证明了\\n自己才是真正的沙土女王！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bcaa5ac38b000ddb33413bf1e039596b4b1485cb7b54260edb7b65f2c31bd53",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9173"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a81b12b3cc397373edd96d1e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "在草地12海里进行的赛马娘最强决定战，\\n育马者杯草地大赛！\\n战火终于，在此时点燃！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a2446ed3b5924128387d1a796822c8da195c46fe02d119480be748b486f5a53",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9174"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38836453fe89f2f3c2f7bd8a",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank_l1！\\n以精彩绝伦的跑法制霸了育马者杯草地大赛，\\n将草地之王的荣冠戴在了头上！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8f660b836c3a3c6baba7e03a1bbacdc38468358d8f9029400f3c6c4936d0482",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9175"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d58405c249e80fc956ba1d42",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "为了决出泥地的顶点，\\n在世界最高峰的舞台上优骏们云集于此！\\n育马者杯经典赛，即将开幕！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2a4b6ceebd0aa61785afe9e80564c5d838a65b06209a7f595e943d9ae3868ab",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9176"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8205f9a9510e16cb74f687c",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "第一是%h_rank_l1！\\n制霸了世界最高峰的赛事，\\n出色地登上了泥地界的顶峰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "077d563286d2eb58828aa7092b2d9f3b1c14792ac77ef313642e8bb1156142d5",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9177"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f46bf9ef12dd4b11dfc2a56e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "以草地女王之位为目标，众多数赛马娘在此云集\\n育马者杯雌马草地大赛！\\n哪位赛马娘将为粉丝献上胜利的荣光！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac1bcdeebed547441ce27c300f3a942582513578a0f57478ed74924e36b957f7",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9178"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e366c3c2caa2f42588e3f9c7",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "今年的草地女王是%h_rank_l1!\\n击败了在场的众女杰，将属于自己的胜利荣光\\n传达到了全世界！",
      "source_fingerprint": "47c7a4a7585fb086ff36023e2f604141e2cb47c298a7e706f4d1f4d4999dd88a",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9179"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0f3c7b5ec541d2d68081346",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "跑在中间的是%a_horse1！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e90c2e19f0568cfef0a96506b2a6218e4f1f4e205241193655345b3dc2bfeef",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "918"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba878b72018ce6daa77d71e4",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "为了决出沙土最快，纯粹的短途健将们\\n在深秋的美国集结了！\\n育马者杯短途赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "946130130c3c85668d579089859bf21d97fdd6639490f5e7c07eb412e5ad1fb3",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9180"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40097fb961024bc13bbbc317",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "胜出的是%h_rank_ta1！\\n就在这片美国的土地上，出色地将沙土最快之称号\\n收入囊中！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac9c56fc50484ef6851c4082ec65b3ec8c1ecfa840737c4ba6abc3263f126d33",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9181"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:632aac42c99aed80b67b1579",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "来自世界各地的英里王者在此云集\\n育马者杯英里赛！\\n赌上各自威信的比赛现已开始！\t",
      "source_fingerprint": "24d20c64874218a7b0d3b0689300f676c0174d4c22e2c8fd5a0f22b692faac15",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9182"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d19bddab9f8e12a4c013fe25",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "优胜的是%h_rank_l1!\\n击败了这条战线的专家们，\\n出色地在此展示了英里王者的威信！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee9bb7f8222c07bb43bd99aa63e3c58df19818eda5b2b020eab551e41663281f",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9183"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a33403c6704d7edef38af980",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "仅靠速度难以胜出的这场大舞台\\n展示出速度与技巧并获得胜利的会是哪位赛马娘呢！\\n育马者杯泥地英里赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "acf7e9384661eeb2897564607b3991c9947a1497181dd75f91227bf1045dea5a",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9184"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a925badb902f9f323c3e6a1e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "赢了！%h_rank_l1!\\n将全副身心投入到这场大赛中，\\n出色地登上了泥地英里的顶点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "73a245bb775478ea75c4968e976573635b68795a035e49c50e0f2674ea47901e",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9185"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4daebdbb8fa970721098a220",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "日本的赛马娘制霸了BC雌马草地大赛！\\n在最后关头展现出胜负欲，唯独爱你\\n在美国赢下了GⅠ育马者杯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "329362e6ae076e9f45e1006c0e832b7fef6ac8b9d34b68fea149e88cc10bebd2",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9186"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59b932a87d67f2be8a3fa1ce",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "太强了，希望之城实在太强了！\\n即便是在世界的沙土上也早已没有敌手！\\n正是希望之城！",
      "source_fingerprint": "62e446824713b88642116b8d4fabcc23b650e330e5c6392b81ab1c8a8f8deb18",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9187"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63f96fa52f56137768dd9bdc",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "胜出的是%h_rank_ta1！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1246f984b7b6510f5c90773e7e10c70846499f2b385d6ca02320fd64e62c1b36",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
